                            &lt;h2&gt;&lt;a href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/releases/tag/2.12.14"&gt;2.12.14&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
                            &lt;div&gt;
                                &lt;h2&gt;What's Changed&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Impact: "high" if using &lt;em&gt;cluster&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;high-integrity-mode&lt;/em&gt; together (resolves an issue that can mis-report &lt;code&gt;-MOVED&lt;/code&gt; responses as integrity failures)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve critical failure in high-integrity-mode with -MOVED response by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4194456211" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3049" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3049/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3049"&gt;#3049&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Allow heartbeat to restart the pipe thread with only sync commands by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/frobion/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/frobion"&gt;@frobion&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="3472796477" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/2965" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2965/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/2965"&gt;#2965&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;GitHubActions logger; exclude passed/skipped by &lt;a class="user-mention notranslate" data-hovercard-type="user" data-hovercard-url="/users/mgravell/hovercard" data-octo-click="hovercard-link-click" data-octo-dimensions="link_type:self" href="https://github.com/mgravell"&gt;@mgravell&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a class="issue-link js-issue-link" data-error-text="Failed to load title" data-id="4152721785" data-permission-text="Title is private" data-url="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/issues/3045" data-hovercard-type="pull_request" data-hovercard-url="/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3045/hovercard" href="https://github.com/StackExchange/StackExchange.Redis/pull/3045"&gt;#3045&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
